{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-api-patterns","title":"Stream API 进阶模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/modern-java-ecosystem/stream-api-patterns","wordCount":811,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"stream-api-进阶模式\">Stream API 进阶模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Stream API 是 Java 8 引入的函数式数据处理框架，提供了声明式的集合操作方式。Stream 不是数据结构，而是从数据源（集合、数组、IO）出发，通过一系列中间操作（过滤、映射、排序）形成流水线，最终由终端操作（收集、归约、遍历）触发执行。理解 Stream 的惰性求值和短路特性，以及 Collector 的组合能力，是高效使用 Stream API 的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[数据源] --&gt; B[中间操作 1]&#10;    B --&gt; C[中间操作 2]&#10;    C --&gt; D[中间操作 N]&#10;    D --&gt; E[终端操作]&#10;    E --&gt; F[结果]&#10;    subgraph 惰性求值&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[数据源] --&gt; B[中间操作 1]\n    B --&gt; C[中间操作 2]\n    C --&gt; D[中间操作 N]\n    D --&gt; E[终端操作]\n    E --&gt; F[结果]\n    subgraph 惰性求值\n        B\n        C\n        D\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>外部迭代（for 循环）</th>\n<th>Stream 内部迭代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制权</td>\n<td>调用方控制</td>\n<td>框架控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行化</td>\n<td>手动分割+合并</td>\n<td>parallelStream()</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性求值</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>中间操作延迟执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短路</td>\n<td>手动 break</td>\n<td>findFirst/anyMatch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可组合性</td>\n<td>嵌套循环</td>\n<td>链式调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>命令式</td>\n<td>声明式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高级-collector\">高级 Collector</h2><p>Collectors 工具类提供了大量预定义的收集器，同时支持自定义收集器来处理复杂的归约逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>分组与分区</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"Map&lt;Department, List&lt;Employee&gt;&gt; byDept = employees.stream()&#10;    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Employee::getDepartment));&#10;&#10;Map&lt;Department, Long&gt; countByDept = employees.stream()&#10;    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(&#10;        Employee::getDepartment,&#10;        Collectors.counting()&#10;    ));&#10;&#10;Map&lt;Department, Optional&lt;Employee&gt;&gt; topEarners = employees.stream()&#10;    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(&#10;        Employee::getDepartment,&#10;        Collectors.maxBy(Comparator.comparingDouble(Employee::getSalary))&#10;    ));&#10;&#10;Map&lt;Department, DoubleSummaryStatistics&gt; salaryStats = employees.stream()&#10;    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(&#10;        Employee::getDepartment,&#10;        Collectors.summarizingDouble(Employee::getSalary)&#10;    ));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> byDept </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupingBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getDepartment));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> countByDept </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupingBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getDepartment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">counting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Optional&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> topEarners </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupingBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getDepartment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Comparator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">comparingDouble</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getSalary))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DoubleSummaryStatistics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> salaryStats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color: