uot;.formatted(avg, count)&#10;    )&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">teeing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">averagingDouble</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getSalary),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">counting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (avg, count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"平均薪资: %.2f, 人数: %d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg, count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Stream 采用惰性求值，中间操作不会立即执行，终端操作触发整个流水线</li>\n<li>Collectors 提供分组（groupingBy）、分区（partitioningBy）、汇总（summarizing）等强大收集器，支持多级组合</li>\n<li>flatMap 是处理嵌套结构的核心，Java 16 的 mapMulti 是一对少数映射的命令式替代</li>\n<li>并行流适合大数据量 + CPU 密集型 + 支持高效分割的数据源，避免共享可变状态和 IO 密集操作</li>\n<li>实战模式包括构建索引、分页分组、Stream 复用（Supplier 延迟创建）和 teeing 双收集</li>\n<li>Stream 不适合所有场景——简单循环、需要提前终止或有复杂分支的逻辑，传统 for 循环更清晰</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Stream API 进阶模式","id":"stream-api-进阶模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"高级 Collector","id":"高级-collector"},{"level":2,"text":"flatMap 与流的扁平化","id":"flatmap-与流的扁平化"},{"level":2,"text":"并行流与性能","id":"并行流与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream 实战模式","id":"stream-实战模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Java 模块系统 JPMS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/modern-java-ecosystem/module-system-jpms"},"next":{"title":"Java 构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/modern-java-ecosystem/java-build-tools"}}